          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "For me the main feature is to switch profiles in UI, and I don't like having to restart or getting a warning about the need for a restart.\n\nI think the issue with unregistration of \"MIBs\" proto must be solved first, and then this UAT can be made profile specific.",
